# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Sixty's — Books. Configuration.
# Copy to .env.local for local development; set the same two keys for each
# Vercel environment (Production, Preview). Never commit real values.
#
# Both are REQUIRED. There is deliberately no built-in default: without them
# the app shows "Not configured" and touches nothing, so a copy of the app can
# never write to another business's books by accident.
#
# No service-role key is used or wanted: the app acts only as the signed-in
# person, and the database decides what that person may see and do.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase → Project Settings → API → Project URL
# (local stack: http://127.0.0.1:54321)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase → Project Settings → API → anon / publishable key
# (local stack: shown by `supabase status`)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
